      "message": "so this means that in order for a user to delete a specific project that isn\u0027t a leaf node, they have to go through and delete every subtree, correct? \n\nHow are we going to address the case where subtrees are massive? I know this might be a little out of the scope of this review given there are scale issues above a given hierarchical depth. Is there plans to delete a project, possibly recursively?",
