      "writtenOn": "2014-10-07T13:38:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s right. We are going to discuss about the best approach to delete not leaf projects in the Paris Summit. There are some options: delete the whole branch recursively; delete only the project and then, connect its child with its parent; or both, via some flag.\n\nNote that we delete all projects recursively from the leafs at delete_domain().",
